WEBVTT

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:03.360
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:06.400
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:11.780
Oh no, we're gonna be late!

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:13.480
Let's hurry!

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:16.660
Weird, I'm not supposed to be the 
kind of character who's ever late... {oh, Ran}

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.940
I wonder what she's doing?

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:32.960
I'll help you up.

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:45.220
Your clothes are soaked. 
Will you be alright?

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:46.660
Aye!

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:48.600
That's good. And you're not hurt?

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:50.360
Aye!

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:51.840
Here's a towel.

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:52.860
Thanks.

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:54.520
I'm moved!

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:56.340
Thanksies!

00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:59.320
No problem.

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:03.840
Ah! You were in the 17th National Pop Girl Grand Prix—

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:05.750
Arisugawa Otome-chan!

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:09.660
You were in commercials for Pop'n Popcorn, Cheerful Pop Candy,

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:13.680
and Get'cha Cold: Freezing Ice Pop, weren't you?

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:16.180
Bingo! Right on!

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:19.680
You fit the image of a mascot in a commercial perfectly!

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:21.800
Otome-chan's adorable!

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:23.680
Oh no!

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:25.860
And with that...

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:26.770
We're late.

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:30.040
I'm sorry, this is all my fault.

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:32.720
Anyway, you should changed if you don't want to get sick.

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:35.500
Right! I'll do that!

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:40.040
Love you!

00:01:58.990 --> 00:02:00.420
Hi, signalize!

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:05.760
The answer lies on the other side of the sky

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:05.760
kotae wa motto takai sora no kanata

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:07.650
No, that's wrong

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:07.650
iie chigau yo

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:13.030
I can see with my eyes that it's at the end of the Earth

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:13.030
boku no me ni mo mieta chi no hate

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:14.820
Do that signalize!

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:20.000
Something's starting to bubble up

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:20.000
hageshiku natta mune no atsui powaa

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:23.960
From the burning power in my raging heart

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:23.960
sou da minagiru nanika ga

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:27.500
So I'll believe in the present

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:27.500
dakara ima wo shinjite

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:32.670
And start today since it's more than a faint desire

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:32.670
hajimeyou tada no akogare ja nai

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:34.010
Chance for me

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:39.310
Dreams can make even the harshest nightmare pleasant

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:39.310
zankoku na yume ga yume de yume ni narunda

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:43.520
It's just another challenge on the way

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:43.520
hora chousen matteru yo

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:48.440
Where are we headed?

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:48.440
kimi to mukau basho wa doko darou

00:02:49.070 --> 00:02:52.190
Into a brilliant hope

00:02:49.070 --> 00:02:52.190
mabushii kibou no naka e

00:02:52.780 --> 00:02:59.450
Where do we want to go? Let's go find it right now

00:02:52.780 --> 00:02:59.450
nozomu basho wa doko darou sagashi ni ikou yo shuppatsu da

00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:02.830
Where we're headed

00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:02.830
mukau basho wa mirai no

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:06.710
is into our hopes for the future

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:06.710
bokura no kibou no naka ni

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:14.050
Our destination is the future, the light is our signal Let's go, go!

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:14.050
nozomu basho wa mirai no kagayaki ga aizu let's go, go

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:23.520
Otome-chan sure was cute.

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:26.060
Her airheadedness was the best!

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:29.560
By the way, why were you in the fountain?

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:34.200
Well you know, this beautiful rainbow appeared in the fountain.

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:37.920
I wanted to touch it so badly, so I reached out my hand,

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:40.600
and then *splash*!

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:42.900
"And then *splash*", she said!

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:44.600
So cute!

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:46.960
Is that *splash* thing really that cute?

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:48.860
It's cute.

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:51.060
Well, at least she didn't hurt herself.

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:55.760
And Johnny-sensei wasn't here yet, so we weren't even late.

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:57.340
It's my lucky day!

00:03:57.960 --> 00:04:00.520
Good morning, honeys!

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:01.840
Sorry I was late.

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:06.680
But! I brought good news.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:08.100
Good job, me!

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:11.260
Sensei sure is excited every day.

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:12.120
You said it.

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:13.380
Look here.

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:18.480
A Christmas tree!

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:20.120
A special event?

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:22.860
Yes! Listen, honeys.

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:25.460
Christmas this year will be great!

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:30.520
As you can see, there will be a special event on Christmas Eve—

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:31.120
Yeah!

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:33.640
I wonder what it'll be? Sounds exciting!

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:34.620
It does!

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.080
However,

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:40.060
if you want to participate in the event you must pass an audition.

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:42.880
The number of people per year who can participate in the event is a meager...

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:44.060
three people!

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:45.100
Only three!

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:46.820
Only three?

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:47.380
Three people?

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:48.160
That few?

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:50.060
It'll be a tough battle.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:50.760
Yeah.

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:52.540
I wish you luck.

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:55.520
Make a Christmas miracle!

00:04:56.340 --> 00:04:57.760
A tournament, huh.

00:04:57.760 --> 00:05:02.160
Only the three people who make it to the end can participate in the event.

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:03.420
Let's go for it!

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:04.140
Yeah.

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:05.020
Ah!

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:05.780
What?

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:08.760
Look! Your opponent in the first round...

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:10.040
It's Otome-chan!

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:12.080
Ah, you're right!

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:15.680
In a way, she's formidable.

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:17.040
Yay!

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:19.540
I get to battle with Otome-chan!

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:20.800
Why are you celebrating?

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:23.760
That's right. Otome-chan will be tough to beat.

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:26.860
But I really like Otome-chan!

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:29.740
It doesn't really matter if you like her or not.

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:31.180
Well, do your best.

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:31.900
Yep!

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:34.960
A showdown between Hoshimiya and Arisugawa.

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:38.080
A true fight between airheads.

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:41.880
Headmistress, do you know what you get when you put two airheads together?

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:43.080
What is it?

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.570
A miracle, you see.

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:48.820
You mean they're unpredictable?

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:50.040
Yes.

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:52.820
There's a possibility they'll awaken a miracle.

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:55.240
Right.

00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:57.320
Looks like this will be a wonderful fight.

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:59.800
Yeah! Happy Merry Christmas!

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:01.360
It's still too early!

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:05.500
Pop'n Pop, Pop'n Pop!

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:10.080
Po-po-po po-po-po Pop'n Popcorn!

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:13.300
Explosively fun, Pop'n Popcorn!

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:17.580
Aoi, that was another one of Otome-chan's commercials.

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:19.600
I've seen them a lot these days.

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:24.660
Yeah. And even though I just had dinner, I kind of got the urge to eat some Pop'n Popcorn.

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:27.620
What's wrong, Aoi?

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:29.100
Does your stomach hurt?

00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:30.220
No way.

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:33.880
I was just worried that you might not be taking this seriously enough.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:37.720
You're facing Otome-chan in the first round.

00:06:37.720 --> 00:06:39.790
You'll lose if you aren't careful.

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:43.280
Right. That's why I'm watching as much of Otome-chan's videos as I can.

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:47.640
She seems more and more cute every time I look at her.

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:50.300
That's making me want to try even harder.

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:52.320
I see.

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:53.060
Yeah.

00:06:53.060 --> 00:06:55.800
Okay! I won't lose to you!

00:06:55.800 --> 00:06:57.320
I'm cheering for you.

00:06:57.320 --> 00:06:59.080
You give it your best too.

00:06:59.080 --> 00:06:59.880
I will!

00:07:05.740 --> 00:07:06.820
Good evening!

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:08.820
Oh, what is it?

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:11.440
Thanks so much for this morning.

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:13.070
Would you like to eat this with me?

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:17.580
Oh, I'm sorry. I don't eat sweets at night.

00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:21.320
Then I'll go get a salted one for you instead of this strawberry one.

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:22.760
Um, that's not what I...

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:23.780
Good night!

00:07:23.780 --> 00:07:24.840
Hey!

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:31.720
Otome gave me this...

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:35.200
She said to eat it with everyone.

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:35.860
Huge!

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:36.500
Yeah.

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:39.000
Yay! It's Pop'n Popcorn!

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:41.060
Let's dig in!

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:45.800
I wonder if we'll be able to finish all of this?

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:47.040
Yeah, right.

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:48.380
It's great!

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:50.800
Otome-chan really is a good girl.

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:52.920
On the other hand, she's also very strong-willed.

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:54.380
Strong-willed?

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:59.080
Even though she normally seems so delicate, she gets back up every time she falls,

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:02.000
and has the strength to overcome her faults by being positive.

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:06.200
Even in terms of this popcorn last night,

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:09.620
one would normally be discouraged after that rejection.

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:13.000
Anyway, that girl is formidable.

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:16.160
She kind of has the same scent as Ichigo.

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:17.660
Same scent?

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:20.720
When you put it like that, these two are pretty similar.

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:22.520
Really? Thanks!

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:24.860
You really are similar.

00:08:24.860 --> 00:08:29.020
Like your optimism, and how you bring brightness wherever you go.

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:30.780
And how she's an airhead.

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:32.420
Huh? Airhead?

00:08:33.560 --> 00:08:36.460
Now I'm getting excited to see their showdown.

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:38.140
Yeah, me too.

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:43.060
I'm looking forward to it too! I hope the audition day comes soon.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:49.670
Ah, groundskeeper guy!

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.240
Good morning!

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:52.120
Hey.

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:54.400
Ah, we've got to run.

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:55.940
See you later!

00:08:56.780 --> 00:08:57.430
Hey.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:02.740
If she's just planning to have fun against Arisugawa Otome,

00:09:02.740 --> 00:09:05.200
Hoshimiya Ichigo won't win.

00:09:06.700 --> 00:09:09.560
Aoi, Ran, hurry up!

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:11.580
We're gonna be late!

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:13.540
Come on!

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:28.020
That was delicious.

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:30.140
I can't believe you finished it.

00:09:30.140 --> 00:09:32.060
There was so much of it...

00:09:32.060 --> 00:09:34.840
Popcorn! Love you!

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:37.720
You two really are alike, you and Otome.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:39.540
Looks like this'll be a good fight.

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:43.320
You can't let your guard down, Ichigo.

00:09:43.320 --> 00:09:44.140
Huh?

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:45.060
Look at this.

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:48.020
That sounds wonderful.

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.560
I've always loved rainbows.

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:54.580
There have even been times when I've gotten lost following after a rainbow.

00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:56.000
That's so cute!

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:57.660
She's laying it on thick.

00:09:57.660 --> 00:09:59.560
The important part is coming up.

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:04.060
I really love Pop'n Popcorn!

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:07.600
I can even finish this double large box.

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:08.480
Om nom.

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:09.560
Amazing!

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:12.680
But after I eat, I always go out and exercise.

00:10:12.680 --> 00:10:13.840
Good idea.

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:19.000
I'd be sad if I gained weight from eating too much and couldn't wear my favorite clothes anymore,

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:22.800
especially since I want to keep on eating Pop'n Popcorn!

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:24.480
I get it.

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:27.400
What that means is that even though Otome is a huge airhead,

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:30.120
she's putting in a lot of effort as an idol too.

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:32.600
Otome-chan's amazing!

00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:36.720
I had a ton of popcorn too, so I need to go get some exercise too.

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:38.840
I'm gonna go for a quick run.

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:43.900
At least it looks like they'll help each other reach new heights.

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:46.660
Yeah. But I'm still worried.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:51.000
The groundskeepter said that Ichigo won't be able to beat Otome.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.380
I wonder what he meant.

00:10:55.380 --> 00:11:00.420
Ai-katsu! Ai-katsu!

00:11:25.860 --> 00:11:27.360
Ichigo-chan!

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:31.920
Sorry! I must've messed up your concentration.

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:34.420
Don't worry about it. Actually,

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:37.920
I'm so embarrassed! I got caught in such a weird pose.

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:40.930
Not at all! It was wonderful, Otome-chan.

00:11:41.280 --> 00:11:42.980
You were like a swan.

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:45.920
A swan? Really?

00:11:46.170 --> 00:11:47.310
Yeah!

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:48.680
That's great!

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:52.520
I was just doing image training about being a swan flying through the sky.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:53.780
Huh? Image training?

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:56.080
It means using your imagination.

00:11:56.080 --> 00:12:00.940
I have a job next year where I'll be playing the part of a swan, so I was practicing for it.

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:05.440
Wow, it's amazing that you're already training for a job you have next year.

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:07.340
I'm a bit of a klutz.

00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:10.540
That's why I need to practice much more than other people.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:15.180
But no matter how much I train, I get scared during the real deal.

00:12:15.180 --> 00:12:19.200
So no matter what I need to practice more and more.

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:26.200
Otome-chan said she gets scared during the real deal, huh.

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:30.080
Yeah. She said that's why she trains so much.

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:32.060
She's such a hard worker.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:32.700
Yeah.

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:35.160
And yet, I...

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:39.600
I was just thinking about how fun it'll be to audition with Otome-chan.

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:43.150
I have no chance of beating her like this.

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:47.060
So that's what the groundskeeper meant.

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:50.320
He knew that Ichigo wouldn't be able to beat Otome-chan.

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:51.840
That's how it is.

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:54.280
I can't believe myself.

00:12:54.280 --> 00:12:59.860
I even knew that Mizuki-chan was doing intense training where nobody could see her.

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:02.940
I'm going to go for another run!

00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:03.860
Fast!

00:13:04.140 --> 00:13:06.180
Acting as soon as she thinks of something.

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:08.220
That's another one of her good points.

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:09.320
Right.

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:36.420
You okay, Ichigo? Don't push yourself too hard.

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:38.260
I-I'm fine.

00:13:38.260 --> 00:13:40.440
This much is nothing...

00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:44.980
M-My muscles hurt!

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:46.380
I thought so.

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:48.120
Go get in the bath right now.

00:13:48.120 --> 00:13:49.880
You need to relax your muscles.

00:13:50.480 --> 00:13:52.140
Alright.

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:00.320
Mizuki-chan and Otome-chan.

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:02.360
And probably Aoi and Ran too.

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:06.080
Everyone's doing their best in unseen places.

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:08.820
I need to put more effort in!

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:12.380
But how should I go about that?

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:23.600
Ichigo?

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:30.780
Training alone?

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:31.660
Ah, yes.

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:33.360
You look pretty pumped up.

00:14:33.360 --> 00:14:34.140
I am...

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:38.380
But I'm not sure exactly what I should be doing now.

00:14:38.380 --> 00:14:42.380
I always end up running or exercising and my muscles get tired.

00:14:43.380 --> 00:14:45.340
Are you a muscle idiot?

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:48.660
You sing at auditions, right?

00:14:48.660 --> 00:14:49.360
Right...

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:51.780
Are the lyrics engraved into your heart?

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:52.620
Huh?

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:55.140
Have they pierced your chest?

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:59.040
Um, I have memorized them...

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:00.800
Memorized?

00:15:01.280 --> 00:15:02.860
I can't believe this...

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:06.540
The lyrics convey a message to those who listen.

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:11.060
Don't just memorize them, shout them with your soul.

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:14.040
Shout them... with my soul?

00:15:17.340 --> 00:15:18.860
What's she doing?

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:22.600
Figuring out how to shout those lyrics with her soul, apparently.

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:23.320
What?

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:27.320
"Softly from the sky falls a gentle white, like a feather"

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:31.700
These are nice!

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:37.880
<i>The more I listen, the more 
I like it. What nice lyrics.</i>

00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:39.080
Ichigo-chan?

00:15:39.820 --> 00:15:41.280
Otome-chan!

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:44.080
Ichigo-chan...

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:47.200
Did you come to check on the rainbow too?

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:48.090
Huh? No...

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:53.180
Every once in a while a rainbow appears at this fountain, so I'm here to check it out.

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:58.120
But they don't come out in winter much, and it's cloudy today so I guess it won't appear.

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:11.680
A rainbow!

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:12.840
Yeah!

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:18.400
It's like a miracle.

00:16:18.400 --> 00:16:20.000
Love you!

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:22.780
We did it, Otome-chan!

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:26.880
Thanks, Ichigo-chan!

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:30.800
Let's both do our best at tomorrow's audition.

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:31.840
Yeah!

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:39.420
And so, the day of the audition came along.

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:44.810
Only the three people who pass the audition will be allowed to appear in the Christmas special event.

00:16:45.110 --> 00:16:47.380
It'd be great if all three of us could pass.

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:48.080
Right!

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:49.560
Let's put out our best!

00:16:51.140 --> 00:16:53.240
Yeah!

00:16:54.460 --> 00:16:55.600
Mizuki-san.

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:57.860
The miracle of Christmas.

00:16:57.860 --> 00:16:59.100
Huh?

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:02.340
A miracle isn't something that you wait for to happen.

00:17:02.340 --> 00:17:04.560
It's something that you <i>make</i> happen. {emphasis}

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:05.870
Good luck.

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:07.260
Thank you!

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:14.010
I'm a bit scared.

00:17:16.020 --> 00:17:18.020
Don't worry. Let's go!

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:19.640
Ichigo-chan...

00:17:20.490 --> 00:17:21.510
Yeah!

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:51.980
Hoshimiya Ichigo and Arisugawa Otome have taken the stage!

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:54.520
Go for it, Ichigo! You too, Otome-chan!

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:56.460
Break a leg, you two!

00:20:42.660 --> 00:20:47.200
By the slimmest of margins, the winner is Hoshimiya Ichigo!

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:50.310
Ichigo-chan!

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:54.000
You were truly awesome! 
That was really, really fun!

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:55.840
I'm moved!

00:20:55.840 --> 00:20:57.000
Congratulations!

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:58.800
Otome-chan...

00:20:58.800 --> 00:20:59.980
Thanks!

00:21:04.680 --> 00:21:08.540
Why? I'm really trying to congratulate you,

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:10.480
so why am I crying?

00:21:10.480 --> 00:21:11.500
O-Otome-chan?

00:21:12.340 --> 00:21:14.820
Ichigo-chan, sorry for crying.

00:21:14.820 --> 00:21:17.480
Even I'm surprised at this!

00:21:17.480 --> 00:21:18.880
Surpri-prised!

00:21:20.720 --> 00:21:21.880
Otome-chan!

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:24.630
I've become a fan of yours!

00:21:25.340 --> 00:21:27.420
Ichigo-chan...

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:28.640
Love you!

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:31.240
Listen, honeys.

00:21:31.240 --> 00:21:32.300
Headmistress?

00:21:32.300 --> 00:21:33.580
Johnny-sensei?

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:36.660
Shibuki, looks like you passed your audition without much problem.

00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:37.540
Yes.

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:41.720
Kiriya, you also did a great job passing. That was well-done research on your opponent.

00:21:41.720 --> 00:21:43.270
Thank you very much.

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:45.400
And Arisugawa.

00:21:45.640 --> 00:21:46.400
Yes...

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:50.420
I can't have you feeling depressed now. 
The losers' revival match is waiting for you.

00:21:50.420 --> 00:21:51.380
Huh?

00:21:51.380 --> 00:21:53.660
Losers' revival match?

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:56.400
Yes! It's called the Revenge Audition.

00:21:56.760 --> 00:21:57.940
What?!

00:21:58.720 --> 00:22:01.500
I'm about to make an official announcement to everyone,

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:04.560
but because the level this year was so high,

00:22:04.560 --> 00:22:08.320
we've decided to increase the number of participants by one person.

00:22:08.320 --> 00:22:09.660
Good job, me!

00:22:09.660 --> 00:22:12.160
Hey, I was the one who decided it.

00:22:12.540 --> 00:22:15.300
So there you have it; there's one more chance.

00:22:15.300 --> 00:22:16.580
Do your best.

00:22:19.540 --> 00:22:20.900
Aye!

00:23:55.740 --> 00:23:57.740
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.660 --> 00:24:00.360
They say that even though swans swim so gracefully,

00:24:00.360 --> 00:24:03.220
they're actually kicking their legs really hard underwater!

00:24:03.220 --> 00:24:04.100
Really?

00:24:04.100 --> 00:24:05.880
It said so in a baseball manga I read.

00:24:05.880 --> 00:24:06.580
Huh?

00:24:07.400 --> 00:24:09.880
Everyone's trying their best in unseen places!

00:24:10.900 --> 00:24:12.760
Love you!

00:24:12.880 --> 00:24:15.260
Aoi! Otome-chan is saying "Love you"!

00:24:15.380 --> 00:24:17.760
No way, could she have fallen for someone?

00:24:18.200 --> 00:24:19.810
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:19.810 --> 00:24:21.880
Otome's in Love with Someone.

00:24:21.880 --> 00:24:25.280
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
